iced-x86, MIT (generated tables)
--------------------------------

src/generated.rs holds the SIMD, system and VEX regions of the x86 opcode
maps. A generator in the exav repository (crates/exav-x86/tools/gen-tables,
not part of this crate) emits it by decoding a probe for every prefix, opcode,
/digit and mod combination with iced-x86 and recording the result, so the
tables are derived from iced-x86's data.

